#K8 Task 7: deliberately NO --gc-stress flag. Natural GC thresholds give
#the wider [delivery -> resume] window; measured on the ASan build, forced
#micro-collections (--gc-stress=8) act as scheduling barriers that narrow
#the window (0/50 failures with the rooting fix disabled vs 17/50 without
#the flag). The sleep-gated sender keeps the receiver provably parked.
